All points use C = 1000, 5 fresh attempts/s and 20 queries/s unless stated otherwise;
per-point tables are in §10.1.

**Advertiser abandonment policy.** These runs last 72 h with 48 h of warm-up and 10⁶
advertisers.

| fresh attempts/s | policy | occupancy / C | admissions/s | abandoned / fresh | cumulative wait at admission, median / p95 (s) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | production | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-production.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-production.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-production.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-production.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-production.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |
| 1 | spec (single quote > E) | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-spec.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-spec.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-spec.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-spec.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-spec.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |
| 1 | none | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |
| 20 | production | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-production.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-production.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-production.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-production.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-production.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |
| 20 | spec (single quote > E) | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-spec.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-spec.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-spec.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-spec.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-spec.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |
| 20 | none † | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.utilisation|ci:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.admission_rps|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.abandon_fraction|f:3}} | {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} / {{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.cumwait_waited_p95_s|f:0}} |

† Population-limited: with waits of days, all 10⁶ advertisers are busy, and only
{{abandon.C1000-fresh20-none.fresh_attempt_rps|f:2}} of the configured 20 attempts/s
find an idle advertiser. All `none` runs at 5 and 20 attempts/s are flagged (§10.2).

* The `spec` policy drops single quotes above E, which is stricter than production's
  1.5·E. But it has no cumulative limit: advertisers that keep receiving quotes ≤ E
  stay. Occupancy is the same at 1 attempt/s and slightly higher at 5 and 20
  attempts/s;
  the p95 cumulative wait exceeds 1.5·E.
* Without abandonment, occupancy roughly doubles. This comes at waits of more than a
  day: the median cumulative wait at admission is
  {{abandon.C1000-fresh1-none.cumwait_waited_median_s|f:0}} s at 1 attempt/s. Such waits
  also outlive the ticket keys (F3), which the harness does not model.
* The attempt timeout is therefore the parameter that controls registrar utilisation.

**Topic popularity skew** (Zipf α over 300 topics):
* occupancy: {{skew.C1000-fresh5-alpha0.utilisation|ci:3}} at α = 0,
  {{skew.C1000-fresh5-alpha1.5.utilisation|ci:3}} at α = 1.5;
* share of the cache held by the most popular topic: {{skew.C1000-fresh5-alpha1.5.top_topic_cache_share|f:3}},
  against {{skew.C1000-fresh5-alpha1.5.top_topic_population_share|f:3}} of the advertisers, at α = 1.5.

**IP address distribution:**

| distribution | occupancy / C |
|---|---|
| concentrated (8 /16s) | {{ipdist.C1000-fresh5-concentrated.utilisation|ci:3}} |
| empirical | {{ipdist.C1000-fresh5-empirical.utilisation|ci:3}} |
| diverse | {{ipdist.C1000-fresh5-diverse.utilisation|ci:3}} |

The IP term shifts the equilibrium as the model predicts (larger s, lower u*).

**Query rate** (1–1000 queries/s): no effect on the dynamics, which are identical to
all printed digits. Queries affect only CPU.

**Capacity:** see §6.2.

**IP-tree fix (F2), A/B:** *pending.* This will run after the realtime block on
branch `registrar-overhead-iptree-fix`, at three configurations.
